{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090331093e2074230330417d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis of the progress.md, I can see that we've already used 30+ distinct palettes. I need to create a completely new aesthetic for Dra Fernanda Nirschl that's unique from all previous ones. Let me design a fresh concept:\n\n**Design Direction: Obsidian Noir & Champagne Quartz**\n- A sophisticated, modern aesthetic combining deep obsidian blacks with champagne quartz crystal accents\n- Inspired by luxury crystal jewelry and premium medical aesthetics\n- Unique crystalline/geometric border-radius patterns that feel like faceted quartz crystals\n\n**Typography:**\n- Display: Libre Baskerville (elegant serif)\n- Body: Plus Jakarta Sans (modern geometric)\n\nLet me create the directory structure and build the site:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ff95dba-e97b-438d-8f46-20c21e418dd8","uuid":"311326b6-ced3-4826-8ae2-464708dff153"}
